{"page": 127, "total_pages": 127, "total": 6313, "skills": [{"category": "life-service", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1794187110572, "description": "Turn \"what do I wear tomorrow\" and \"what do I pack away for the season\" from a daily guessing game into one reusable wardrobe sheet. Use when the user says \"what should I wear today\", \"it is going to be cold tomorrow, what do I wear\", \"plan my outfits for the week\", \"how do I switch my wardrobe for winter\", \"how should I store my winter coats\", \"my closet is full and I have nothing to wear\", \"how do I layer for cold mornings\", \"what am I actually missing in my wardrobe\", \"should I buy another jacket\", or pastes a week of weather and asks how to dress. Capabilities: (1) five feel-like bands that fold in wind chill, instead of air temperature or the calendar (2) a day-by-day week plan with inner / mid / outer / bottom, flagging wide day swings that need a removable outer layer (3) a gap list that only asks you to buy when a band has no usable item, so you stop buying duplicates (4) substitution only ever moves warmer, never thinner (5) season switch: hang / fold / pack / hold / let go by wear frequency and band, with a two-hanger fold-hang fix when long-hang slots run out (6) rotation warnings so wool and down get a rest day. Do not trigger for: weather forecasts (use live-weather, this skill does not report weather); price comparison or ordering; fabric care and repair; copying an influencer's style or body-shape fixes; storage of kitchen, paper or electronics; spending decisions outside the wardrobe.", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 2, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_fe2bf65a/wardrobe-rotation-en", "iconUrl": "https://skillhub-1388575217.cos.accelerate.myqcloud.com/skill-icons/uploads/809671/931388a5c86b44578cb5e75de17c0ef1.png", "installs": 0, "isServiceized": false, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at